{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/07ff583f695617767d7a555ef65fe42d.webp?t=1769157306\" width=736 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Raid</strong> \u2014 a <strong>co-op space horror</strong> where you and a crew of scavenger-hackers prowl a starship graveyard. Unlock sealed compartments, break into systems, grab anything valuable, and haul the loot back to the airlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun\u2014and be afraid!</strong> The game features plenty of enemies and content. And watch your oxygen\u2026 it literally depends on your heart rate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/eb1db59a8cb5fa3642a8090833f84821.poster.avif?t=1769157306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/eb1db59a8cb5fa3642a8090833f84821.webm?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the ships aren\u2019t empty:</strong> creatures stalk the corridors, mines and tripwires hide on the floor, and rooms have buttons\u2014one press can fling you to the other end of the deck or obliterate a teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6a3af91a0a4123280c44d4fa513e32af.poster.avif?t=1769157306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6a3af91a0a4123280c44d4fa513e32af.webm?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some loot carries debuffs: keep an item in your hands and your flashlight may flicker, your legs may slow, or you may lose comms with the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6206f7c5406c7ce9ae3cc4487d0d0bd6.poster.avif?t=1769157306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6206f7c5406c7ce9ae3cc4487d0d0bd6.webm?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6206f7c5406c7ce9ae3cc4487d0d0bd6.mp4?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tools, upgrade your suits, and assign roles\u2014victory goes to those who can weigh risks and leave on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Several enemy types with different behaviors\u2014you\u2019ll never fully predict them thanks to solid AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive items: Crates \u2014 smash them for extra cash; it doesn\u2019t count toward the quota, but you can use it to buy other items. Buttons \u2014 dare to press? You might explode, or you might get something nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main computer: Follow the news, purchase items, and launch ship hacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to survive, gather items on the derelicts you find and sell them! That way you won\u2019t starve out here.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961850?t=1769157306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/ad871966b22cf24aac2b0454cfffbc21968ae0a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769157306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/08d7f46c51c529978f758463fb4ee40866899c4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769157306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/08d7f46c51c529978f758463fb4ee40866899c4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769157306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/07ff583f695617767d7a555ef65fe42d.webp?t=1769157306\" width=736 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Raid</strong> \u2014 a <strong>co-op space horror</strong> where you and a crew of scavenger-hackers prowl a starship graveyard. Unlock sealed compartments, break into systems, grab anything valuable, and haul the loot back to the airlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun\u2014and be afraid!</strong> The game features plenty of enemies and content. And watch your oxygen\u2026 it literally depends on your heart rate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/eb1db59a8cb5fa3642a8090833f84821.poster.avif?t=1769157306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/eb1db59a8cb5fa3642a8090833f84821.webm?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the ships aren\u2019t empty:</strong> creatures stalk the corridors, mines and tripwires hide on the floor, and rooms have buttons\u2014one press can fling you to the other end of the deck or obliterate a teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6a3af91a0a4123280c44d4fa513e32af.poster.avif?t=1769157306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6a3af91a0a4123280c44d4fa513e32af.webm?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some loot carries debuffs: keep an item in your hands and your flashlight may flicker, your legs may slow, or you may lose comms with the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6206f7c5406c7ce9ae3cc4487d0d0bd6.poster.avif?t=1769157306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6206f7c5406c7ce9ae3cc4487d0d0bd6.webm?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/extras/6206f7c5406c7ce9ae3cc4487d0d0bd6.mp4?t=1769157306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy tools, upgrade your suits, and assign roles\u2014victory goes to those who can weigh risks and leave on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Several enemy types with different behaviors\u2014you\u2019ll never fully predict them thanks to solid AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive items: Crates \u2014 smash them for extra cash; it doesn\u2019t count toward the quota, but you can use it to buy other items. Buttons \u2014 dare to press? You might explode, or you might get something nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main computer: Follow the news, purchase items, and launch ship hacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to survive, gather items on the derelicts you find and sell them! That way you won\u2019t starve out here.</p>","developers":["macrayb"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961850/5e279b9b0f9a2fc49940e9bd6a0ac0552d331b76/header.jpg?t=1769157306","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961850/1669509084/a85188b158988fe4e9bdf2b938e5048acd59b3c3/1759477646/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759851384","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961850/1669509084/a85188b158988fe4e9bdf2b938e5048acd59b3c3/1759477646/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759851384","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961850/1669509084/a85188b158988fe4e9bdf2b938e5048acd59b3c3/1759477646/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759851384","id":257210719,"name":"GamePlay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210719/21c7b81dd0c84b51cbbd9d20d9024ac6ef2fc72f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759851384"}],"name":"Void Raid","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron